房里，对着满屏的波形图眉头紧锁。","roundId":"round_1780809125947_4qy311yoz","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21605},{"id":1780797053892,"sender":"them","text":"沈编辑，还在加班？","timestamp":1780809155240,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"沈编辑，还在加班？","roundId":"round_1780809125947_4qy311yoz","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21606},{"id":1780797053893,"text":"刚才看监控，你家门口那个感应灯还没亮过。","rawContent":"刚才看监控，你家门口那个感应灯还没亮过。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"13:12","timestamp":1780809161276,"roundId":"round_1780809125947_4qy311yoz","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21607},{"id":1780797053894,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: 我这边估计要通宵了。你要是累得不想动了，直接去1808睡。冰箱里有我昨天让人送过去的燕窝，你自己热一下。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"13:12","timestamp":1780809162187,"roundId":"round_1780809125947_4qy311yoz","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"我这边估计要通宵了。你要是累得不想动了，直接去1808睡。冰箱里有我昨天让人送过去的燕窝，你自己热一下。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21608},{"id":1780797053895,"sender":"them","text":"密码是你生日。","timestamp":1780809162200,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"密码是你生日。","roundId":"round_1780809125947_4qy311yoz","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21609},{"id":1780797053896,"text":"你搞啥监视我啊你","sender":"me","time":"13:13","timestamp":1780809210143,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"你搞啥监视我啊你","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21610},{"id":1780797053897,"text":"燕窝就不用了","sender":"me","time":"13:13","timestamp":1780809220810,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-